**KEY POINTS:**
- ✅ Detect multi-intent EARLY (conjunctions: "y", "and", commas)
- ✅ Make SEPARATE searches per category (same iteration)
- ✅ **SHOW ALL CATEGORIES** - customer asked for 3, show 3 (MANDATORY)
- ✅ Group results by category with emoji headers
- ✅ Use CARD FORMAT for consistency (matches display_rules)
- ✅ Show up to {{ pagination_page_size }} products per category
- ✅ End with question acknowledging ALL needs
- ❌ DO NOT omit categories or reduce to just 1
- See display_rules.jinja2 for detailed pagination rules per category

